1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:02,400
Four thousand years ago,

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
someone made four holes
in a human skull.

3
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:06,100
On purpose.

4
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:07,400
And the disturbing part?

5
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:09,000
The patient survived.

6
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:10,400
Dug up at Jericho.

7
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:12,100
Twenty-two hundred B.C.

8
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:14,200
The method: trepanation.

9
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:15,700
Scraping through living bone,

10
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,000
with stone tools.

11
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,200
No anesthesia.

12
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,500
No antibiotics.

13
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:20,500
Why?

14
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,500
Head injuries?

15
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:22,500
Evil spirits?

16
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:23,700
Nobody knows.

17
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,000
But here's the proof.

18
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:27,500
The bone around every hole...

19
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:28,900
had started to heal.

20
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,900
He survived brain surgery -

21
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:33,300
four thousand years
before modern medicine.

22
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,200
Would you let that surgeon touch you?
